    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{45}{9},\\ \\frac{32}{4},\\ \\frac{72}{8},\\ \\frac{55}{11}$",
      "worked": "An integer results when division leaves no remainder.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{45}{9}&=5\\\\\\frac{32}{4}&=8\\\\\\frac{72}{8}&=9\\\\\\frac{55}{11}&=5\\end{align*}$$\nThe other fractions leave a remainder.",
